DTSTAMP:20261124T203150Z
UID:27ih7p22pvmv66a9ui2bfpgaa3@google.com
CREATED:20201020T045041Z
DESCRIPTION:<blockquote><table><tbody><tr><td>Congratulations! You got the 
 job! Now what? Do you have the "3D" vision to be successful?<br>CALLING ALL
  SOPHOMORES\, JUNIORS\, AND SENIORS! Come learn from local Dell Technologie
 s and Optiv professionals.<br><br>One of the greatest challenges is being a
  new hire is navigating the environment.&nbsp\;<br>Your first 90 days are d
 etrimental to how you develop\, engage\, and evolve as a professional.<br>Y
 ou receive a job description and key performance indicators\, but how do yo
 u succeed?<br>It takes grit\, intuition\, and accountability to build your 
 own career.<br>We are here to guide you. This panel session will leave you 
 feeling inspired and confident in following curiosity to make an impact in 
 your career.<br><br><blockquote>In this session\, you will learn from indus
 try experts how to:<br>1. Do well in your job<br>2. Develop skills to be su
 ccessful&nbsp\;<br>3. Determine career path moving forward&nbsp\;</blockquo
 te><br>Goal of the session: To be interactive and informative to develop th
 e next generation in cyber security.<br><br>This program is brought to you 
 by Dell Technologies\, Security &amp\; Resiliency Office in partnership wit
 h Optiv Inc\, Security Solutions Integrator (SSI) to support you to build y
 our own career (BYOC)</td></tr></tbody></table></blockquote>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201020T045108Z
LOCATION:https://optiv.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_du-LX6MwT76-pDLGfEWchg
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Fwd: Dell + Optiv Panel Session - You Got the Job\, Now What?!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
