UID:0cfpac334c3p9gpr7tmm3mug76@google.com
CREATED:20200930T195221Z
DESCRIPTION:For our members\, please consider attending this meeting to tal
 k to Dr. Watson about your experience with UTCS and their Diversity and Inc
 lusion work.\n\nMore info:\n\nDr. Karan L. Watson\, Provost Emeritus and Re
 gents Senior Professor of Electrical and Computer Engineering at Texas A&M 
 University\, will be virtually visiting our department next week to discuss
  diversity and inclusion matters.\n\nDr. Watson has served in numerous admi
 nistrative roles at Texas A&M University\, including Provost and Executive 
 Vice President\, Vice Provost\, Dean of Faculties and Associate Provost\, I
 nterim Vice President for Diversity\, and Associate Dean of Engineering. He
 r awards and recognitions include the U.S. President’s Award for Mentoring 
 Minorities and Women in Science and Technology\, the American Association f
 or the Advancement of Science mentoring award\, the Institute of Electrical
  and Electronics Engineers International Undergraduate Teaching Medal\, and
  many more.\n\nDr. Watson will meet with faculty\, staff\, and student grou
 ps throughout the week\, with the goal of better understanding our departme
 nt culture. We will then use her insight and feedback to inform the departm
 ent’s diversity and inclusion plan.
LAST-MODIFIED:20200930T195221Z
LOCATION:https://utexas.zoom.us/j/92157791298
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dr. Karan L Watson's Meeting with our Members
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
