DESCRIPTION:<p>Join HACS and WorldQuant for another awesome General Meeting
 ! WorldQuant will host a tech talk and Q&amp\;A with the Vice President of 
 Core Services\, Carlos Nocito. Carlos will be offering an inside look on ho
 w to break into the quant finance industry and how technology powers WorldQ
 uant’s daily quantitative investment operations.</p><p><b>Links to apply:</
