 Engineering<u></u><u></u></b></p><p>Join Bloomberg software engineers for a
 n interactive workshop. We will discuss problem solving and challenges face
 d when conceptualizing a project.&nbsp\;<br><br>Software engineering is not
  just writing good code\, it is the art of building maintainable software t
