 orkshop we aim to inculcate a professional mindset around it. Going through
  a series of questions\, you will walk away with a method to approach new p
 rojects and learn how to build software that evolves organically.<u></u><u>
 </u></p><p><u></u><b>When: March 10<sup>th</sup>&nbsp\;at 5:30pm CT</b></p>
