DESCRIPTION:When: Tuesday\, August 28\, 2018 2:00 PM-2:30 PM. (UTC-06:00) C
 entral Time (US & Canada)\nWhere: Jeff Call Christian (832-978-3359)\n\n*~*
 ~*~*~*~*~*~*~*~*\n\nJeff to Call Christian for quick intro and next steps\n
 \nFrom: Texas HACS <texashacs@gmail.com>\nDate: Monday\, August 27\, 2018 a
 t 3:26 PM\nTo: "Noble\, Jeff" <JNoble@StateStreet.com>\nSubject: Re: State 
 Street <> UT Hispanic Association for Computer Scientists\n\nHi Jeff\,\n\n2
 pm tomorrow works perfectly for me\, unfortunately I will be near campus an
 d dont have transportation.\n\nThanks\,\nChristian\n\nOn Mon\, Aug 27\, 201
 8 at 9:03 AM\, Noble\, Jeff <JNoble@statestreet.com<mailto:JNoble@statestre
 et.com>> wrote:\nHey Christian\,\n\nI’m free at 2pm on Tuesday if that time
  still works for you?  We can plan on a phone call or if you are anywhere c
 lose to the Domain you could stop by and meet a few people and chat in pers
 on? Either way works for me\, just let me know.\n\nThanks\nJeff\n\nFrom: Te
 xas HACS <texashacs@gmail.com<mailto:texashacs@gmail.com>>\nDate: Friday\, 
 August 24\, 2018 at 8:50 PM\nTo: "Noble\, Jeff" <JNoble@StateStreet.com>\nS
 ubject: Re: State Street <> UT Hispanic Association for Computer Scientists
 \n\nHi Jeff\,\n\nFirstly thank you so much for sponsoring diversity initiat
 ives it really helps us all out! I am Christian the corporate officer of HA
 CS and I am free Monday 11am - 5pm and Tuesday 11am - 5pm. Please let me kn
 ow if those times work during our phone call I can give you a summary of HA
 CS and our current membership statistics. I can also let you know of some o
 f the perks you guys get and a timeline for them!\n\nThanks\,\nChristian\n\
 nOn Fri\, Aug 24\, 2018 at 3:57 PM\, Noble\, Jeff <JNoble@statestreet.com<m
 ailto:JNoble@statestreet.com>> wrote:\nHey Christian\,\n\nThanks to Katie f
 or the introduction!\n\nWe are excited to join the Friends of Computer Scie
 nce and be sponsoring the UT Hispanic Association for Computer Scientists a
 s a platinum sponsor! Please let me know when you are all available and we 
 can setup a quick introduction call or happy to have you and others come by
  our office in the Domain.\n\nThanks\nJeff\n\n\nFrom: Katie Banks <kbanks@c
 s.utexas.edu<mailto:kbanks@cs.utexas.edu>>\nDate: Thursday\, August 23\, 20
 18 at 1:59 PM\nTo: "Noble\, Jeff" <JNoble@StateStreet.com>\nCc: Texas HACS 
 <texashacs@gmail.com<mailto:texashacs@gmail.com>>\nSubject: State Street <>
  UT Hispanic Association for Computer Scientists\n\nHi Jeff\,\nI'd like to 
 introduce you to Christian Gonzalez\, Corporate Officer for UT's Hispanic A
 ssociation for Computer Scientists. Christian will be your lead contact for
  getting State Street engaged with HACS during the upcoming school year. He
  can let you know what events they have scheduled already and discuss other
  opportunities. Thank you again for State Street's support of HACS\, our Co
 mputing for Diversity program\, and Texas Computer Science!\n\nHi Christian
 \,\nPlease meet Jeff Noble\, VP Global Talent at State Street. State Street
  is sponsoring the Computing for Diversity program at the Platinum level\, 
 and will be supporting all Computing for Diversity initiatives through thei
 r sponsorship. I'll let you get him up to speed on your events and engageme
 nt for the upcoming school year.\n\nI'll let you two take it from here.\n\n
 Thanks again!\nKatie\n\n\n--\n\nKATIE BANKS\, Associate Director\, Corporat
 e Relations and External Affairs\n\nThe University of Texas at Austin | Dep
 artment of Computer Science | 512-232-7476<tel:(512)%20232-7476> | cs.utexa
