 /su/c82e80f1ecff7432</a><br><br><b>Meeting Description:</b><br>During this 
 networking night\, students will really get to know Cisco\, who they are an
 d what they do. Alongside a panel of some of their best LatinX leaders\, st
 udents will be broken into breakout rooms with their volunteers to learn ab
 out their culture\, their LatinX professional network organization (Conexio
 n)\, the various roles open at Cisco and how they give back to their commun
 ities! All through casual networking\, no need for formalities\, just be yo
 urself 😊<br><br><b><u>HUGE prize giveaways at this event!!!</u></b><br>Cis
 co will have a small drone\, a backpack\, and a JBL speaker to raffle off t
 o students who RSVP and come to the meeting!<br><br><b>Meeting Link (Cisco 
