DESCRIPTION:<p><b>&nbsp\;***MUST FILL OUT RSVP FORM***</b><br></p><p><b>RSV
 P Form:</b></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><ul><li><a href="https://forms.o
 ffice.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=GlDrQXH24Eylv7ZBaMNwX5J1-9mVW8xBsQAwEC
 2EDoZUMlpCTkszWkZPNFI2NDFTTTlHVDJHRDQxSiQlQCN0PWcu" id="ow496" __is_owner="
 true">Sign Up for 'How to Facilitate D&amp\;I Discussions'</a></li></ul><br
 ><b>Link to Meeting Invite:</b><br><ul><li><a href="https://teams.microsoft
 .com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_MWIxMTZjN2YtOGYxYy00MWQ3LWI4NTMtZjVlNTZmMjB
 mMmRk%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%2241eb501a-f671-4ce0-a5bf-b6416
 8c3705f%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22cdb214d7-601c-4dae-995c-a03007baea3b%22%7d" id=
 "ow506" __is_owner="true">Credera\, HACS\, WiCS Present: How to Facilitate 
 Diversity &amp\; Inclusion Discussions</a></li></ul><p></p><br>The goal of 
 this round table is to humanize diversity and inclusion in your student org
 anizations and future<br>workplace. During this event\, Credera will presen
 t a few opening slides to the wider group\, and then we will breakout into 
 smaller groups to walk through a series of questions around privilege.<br><
 br>At Credera\, we care about acknowledging privilege\, and we want to talk
  about it because thinking and<br>talking about privilege is challenging. W
 e want everyone to have a voice so that privilege can be understood<br>and 
 used for good\, where appropriate\, by all. We hope you’ll consider joining
  us at this event!<br><br><p><b>Credera Job Postings:<u></u><u></u></b></p>
 <ul><li>Full-time technology consulting:&nbsp\;<a href="https://grnh.se/d3b
 431731us">https://grnh.se/d3b431731us</a><b><u></u><u></u></b></li><li>Inte
 rnship technology consulting:&nbsp\;<a href="https://grnh.se/54b508511us">h
 ttps://grnh.se/54b508511us</a><b>&nbsp\;</b></li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210205T184332Z
